- Relation: adapted. The skill's procedure and its three reference contracts are forged from the
  upstream workflow, contract, rules and style samples; the bundled `scripts/translate-pair.mjs`
  (source in `package/dsh-spec-translate-docs/`) consolidates the upstream gate and briefing CLIs
  into one command and generalises them: an existing-pair consistency gate instead of corpus
  completeness, one aggregate multi-language record per source, per-file source and target
  languages, selection filters instead of the repository manifest, an existence-aware link
  predicate, the skill's own generated-region format with a section anchor and render/splice CLI,
  a public-URL switcher allowance,
  generated-source globs, and one command surface instead of two `pnpm run` scripts.

